                                        "entry_id": "9f6bd5f8-96b7-3459-844b-e38dacf320f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a fundamental or basic sense; reaching the very core of the matter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cbdf82b-99a9-4474-b994-9226982df6dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a2fe6fef-f264-3f8c-b204-8f8b7e7da40f",
                                                "text": "What the science shows, he says, is that the brain of an addict is fundamentally different from that of a nonaddict."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "377ef536-eba7-4172-9fa4-52ed5513064e",
                                                "sense_id": "a2fe6fef-f264-3f8c-b204-8f8b7e7da40f",
                                                "text": "Hanks is known as being an avid reader of history and biography, and seems to seek out stories which offer a certain optimism and humanism. In other words, he plays – fundamentally – good people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c71c1d3a-1d48-4430-8180-451f73977169",
                                                "sense_id": "a2fe6fef-f264-3f8c-b204-8f8b7e7da40f",
                                                "text": "On Tuesday, a proposal to fundamentally restructure the Minneapolis police department in the wake of George Floyd’s death in 2020 was soundly defeated, a setback that even many Democrats acknowledged could be laid at the feet of the “defund the police” movement that some within the party embraced last summer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
